[{"title":"雪晴","author":"萧澥","text":"一雪晓来旋放晴，瓦沟馀滴响中庭。\n开窗已上三竿日，满岭松梢醉未醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70335,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"萧澥","text":"屋外一蝉鸣树阴，矮窗睡起静沈沈。\n破衣半解斜阳里，扪得虱时多快心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70336,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"韶口山家","author":"萧澥","text":"茅屋一区山四围，门前蓣圃带茭池。\n儿童似骇儒衣到，两两三三壁缝窥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70337,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题东篱采菊图","author":"萧澥","text":"倒樽醉卧菊篱边，此段风流亦偶然。\n要识先生独醒处，平生心事在寒泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70338,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题或林尼院壁","author":"萧澥","text":"剪剪香云翠影寒，更无红粉旧时痕。\n祇因曾悟桃花偈，閒却春风梦几番。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70339,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题壶","author":"萧澥","text":"望断碧云无白衣，一春长是独醒时。\n烦君卷舌东风里，休劝饥人食肉糜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70340,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"避乱山家 其一","author":"萧澥","text":"野人生长在高山，道路崎岖轻往还。\n长是五更炊未熟，已笼鸡鸭送林间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70341,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"避乱山家 其二","author":"萧澥","text":"深村林麓冷飕飕，满眼风光总是愁。\n日月羡渠双喜鹊，自跳自掷树梢头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70342,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乱后过隆教寺","author":"萧澥","text":"纸窗破碎网蜘蛛，古铁香炉灰半无。\n吟得诗成无笔在，闲寻枯炭壁间书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70343,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绍定庚寅纪事 其三","author":"萧澥","text":"桑柘原头绿正肥，巢林春燕引雏飞。\n前村不复炊烟起，长是清明寒食时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70344,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重过邓村","author":"萧澥","text":"瘦竹挑云过此村，十年前事总销魂。\n当时新庙曾题字，壁老泥枯半不存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70345,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寇中逃山 其二","author":"萧澥","text":"才入林峦屏迹时，此身自幸少人知。\n婴孩底苦不解事，偏是怕时方始啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70346,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其二","author":"萧燧","text":"画翣排仙仗，龙輴去莫攀。\n衣冠藏汉庙，弓剑閟桥山。\n宇宙精神惨，臣民涕泗潸。\n尧阶蓂荚在，无复望慈颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70347,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"高宗皇帝挽词 其一","author":"萧燧","text":"拨乱中兴事，艰难创业同。\n好生天地德，立极帝王功。\n与子基图永，居尊福禄崇。\n一朝违大养，悽怆栎阳宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70348,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题汪水云诗卷","author":"萧璩","text":"璧月歌残铁骑围，银涛风急鹢舟飞。\n海山运并随鳌尽，城郭身今化鹤归。\n琴怨诗愁春一雨，江南渭北泪双霏。\n与君厌听桑田语，一笑游丝罥落晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70349,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题汪水云诗卷","author":"萧豳","text":"孀娥灵药被谁偷，碧海青天伴夜愁。\n归郭令威空化鹤，度关老子偶乘牛。\n广陵散在斜阳远，梁父吟成昨雨收。\n我亦云间旧鸡犬，与君相对击茶瓯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70350,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送容斋自福倅满归 其二","author":"叶黯","text":"此地相从惊岁晚，登临况是客归时。\n却将襟抱向谁可，正尔艰难唯子知。\n情到中年工作恶，别于生世易为悲。\n梅花尽醉清江上，黯澹西风冻雨垂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70351,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送容斋自福倅满归 其一","author":"叶黯","text":"一门伯仲知谁似，四海文章正数君。\n何事与予如旧识，由来于世两相闻。\n闲官各喜光阴剩，胜地空多物色分。\n忽复翩然从此去，便应变化上青云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70352,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和洪容斋锁院作","author":"叶黯","text":"文章万言抵杯水，世上虚名徒尔耳。\n我常自笑一生痴，那更将痴笑群子。\n大屋沈沈馀百年，到今所阅知几士。\n看渠得失自偶然，其间悲喜从何起。\n君闻我言亦大笑，为说万事总如此。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n急须了却公家事，门外不知春有几。\n□□□□□□□，□□□□□□□。\n□□□□□□□，飞雨时闻打窗纸。\n他年万一复相从，未必从容今日似。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70353,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山中纪咏 其一","author":"龚文焕","text":"胜地栖迟惯，青山耐久看。\n云烟五洞古，泉石九峰寒。\n已化岩前虎，犹藏箬下丹。\n黄花生意别，秋老不凋残。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70354,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十四","author":"谌祜","text":"观空观化此凭栏，会合人间景一团。\n棋罢客随流水散，酒阑花带夕阳看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70355,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四十一","author":"谌祜","text":"城上鸟乌知息战，陈前笳鼓缓归装。\n将军斗大黄金印，犹待先登缚鬼章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70356,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一一二","author":"谌祜","text":"一声金殿玉阑干，一曲马嵬坡下土。\n夕阳空照古今愁，年年醉醒桃花雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70357,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六十一","author":"谌祜","text":"六鳌倾侧动乾坤，国母巡荒护帝孙。\n北极星辰临草地，西风观阙卧花门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70358,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七十一","author":"谌祜","text":"归来今夕岁云徂，且共平安酒一壶。\n浩劫定中逃得过，旧愁空外看来无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70359,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三十一","author":"谌祜","text":"宫烛骊山酒未醒，妖星䁭䁭弄青荧。\n三朝伐叛知谋略，万国归心服典刑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70360,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一○七","author":"谌祜","text":"东郊独行冰玉时，江左诸贤王谢起。\n若以比花花或宜，自不矜持花亦耻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70361,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五十八","author":"谌祜","text":"天开汉统王巴蜀，云从秦繇起沛丰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70362,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四十四","author":"谌祜","text":"弦管入春波面醉，云天开镜画中行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70363,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六十四","author":"谌祜","text":"梁有字题何岁月，藏无经在亦香镫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70364,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六十七","author":"谌祜","text":"天教向老逢春在，诗且忘忧此命通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70365,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"谌祜","text":"百年窗下棋千著，万事灯前酒一斟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70366,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"谌祜","text":"白发古今天北极，黄华宇宙客西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70367,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十八","author":"谌祜","text":"树带夕阳雅半集，藋寒秋浦雁初来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70368,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六十八","author":"谌祜","text":"何事重来看明月，不堪垂老向西风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70369,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五十六","author":"谌祜","text":"赤帜露光王汉地，锦帆波荡帝隋舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70370,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八十四","author":"谌祜","text":"花柳晴光新态度，江湖春梦老英雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":70371,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892